Package: alex
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christian Peter <https://github.com/prosch88/ALEX>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-tk, adb | android-tools-adb, fastboot | android-tools-fastboot
Recommends: usbutils, python3-venv
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/prosch88/ALEX
Description: Android Logical Extractor (ALEX)
 ADB-based logical/advanced-logical/filesystem acquisition tool
 for Android, FireOS, WearOS and Ubuntu Touch devices.
 .
 This package vendors the Python dependencies from requirements.txt
 under /usr/share/alex/lib, so it works offline after install and
 tracks upstream main on every rebuild.
